        "description":  "The LS50 Wireless II transcends the typical high-end speaker experience, delivering a complete audio solution in one system. Every nuance of your music collection comes through with pristine clarity, and you can stream content from virtually any platform thanks to its comprehensive wireless connectivity, including AirPlay 2 and Chromecast integration. \n\nWhen it comes to streaming options, the LS50 Wireless II leaves nothing left to be dreamed of. Access Spotify directly through the app using Spotify Connect, while the KEF Connect app opens up a world of additional services including Tidal, Amazon Music, Qobuz, and Deezer. Plus, you can enjoy internet radio stations and your favorite podcasts all through the same interface.",
